{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1596240000, "end_date": 1596931199, "month_true_total": 1143, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:21:30 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "74000167", "author": {"steamid": "76561198172423533", "personaname": "BunBunDragn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Dragn_12409810928398123/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1530, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 639, "last_played": 1679257063, "avatar": "82673cebf55063fad6d876dbecec6cf5b6cbedcc"}, "language": "english", "review": "you look for stuff, fend off monsters as they come after your flesh and kick barrels. what more could one person want? oh right, BEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEER", "timestamp_created": 1596931021, "timestamp_updated": 1596931021, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73999887", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058658888", "personaname": "Son of Durin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gillis37xx/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 58467, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7430, "last_played": 1746506286, "avatar": "853fa6809b3114456032d45b4f3130e2bab196dd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great multiplayer game. Hours of fun with friends and random people online. I am a dwarf and I dig in a hole.", "timestamp_created": 1596930442, "timestamp_updated": 1596930442, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525316417217254639", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73999658", "author": {"steamid": "76561197978086755", "personaname": "ᴧ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Onkellal/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1147, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1147, "last_played": 1591232176, "avatar": "7703bc5e6305b0e4321e69aaf4891dd62538ede8"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game gets by on featuring dwarves in space.\nOn the tin it looks great. It has destructible terrain, exploration, the afore mentioned space-dwarves, and it's multiplayer. It should be the perfect \"saturday night gaming with friends and beer\" -game, but it isn't.\n\nThe gameplay is shallow and repetitive. The unlocks are boring. The classes feel to similar in that they can all accomplish the same in marginally different ways, and the enemies are both boring to look at and trivial to defeat, resulting in one-dimensional combat encounters. For all the polish and what the potentially great game universe theoretically has to offer, it fails to deliver anything that hasn't been delivered a million times before with more depth and / or entertainment.\n\nThe game isn't bad, it's just boring. As of writing this a friend of mine summarized the game perfectly: \"I don't understand why this game has such a high rating. It does nothing that Borderlands 2 from ages ago doesn't do a million times better.\"\n\nTo top it off, it's expensive. Consider buying at 75% off. Buying it at its current price is a mistake.\n\n96% positive reviews gives rise to conspiracy theories. This is a 5/10 at the very best.", "timestamp_created": 1596930023, "timestamp_updated": 1596930424, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520717620849609375", "comment_count": 0, "s